comment_data.body:
need to drive back this kind of classic AI over-explanation. define concepts once, then refer to them. don't expand them over and over in every place. AIs have a terrible habit of this, and we need human contributors to combat it.

```suggestion
      // Check if 'breakindent' applies and show it. Like the 'linebreak' filler, an
      // attrs must not extend into this gap either.
```

```suggestion
          // Do not bleed attrs into the filler for the pushed-down
```

